---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import '../styles/globals.css'
---

<Base
  title="HealthPulse — Recovery, Readiness, and Health Intelligence"
  description="HealthPulse turns Apple Health and wearable data into daily readiness, recovery, sleep, strain, risk signals, and long-term trends. Join early access."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">

    <!-- ════════ NAV ════════ -->
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="nav-blur fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 border-b border-gray-100/60">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 h-12 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="#" class="text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark">HealthPulse</a>
        <a href="#early-access" class="bg-apple-dark text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 hover:bg-black transition-colors">
          Get Early Access
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ════════ HERO ════════ -->
    <section data-section="hero" class="hero-gradient pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-44 md:pb-24 px-5 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-apple-blue/10 text-apple-blue text-sm font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-apple-blue rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
        iOS Early Access Open
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-[1.08]">
        Understand your health before
        <span class="gradient-text">it turns into a setback.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-apple-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto text-balance leading-relaxed">
        HealthPulse reads your Apple Health and wearable data together so you can track recovery, strain, sleep,
        stress, risk signals, and long-term health trends in one daily view.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
        <form id="hero-form" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <input
            type="email"
            placeholder="your@email.com"
            required
            class="hero-email-input flex-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-5 py-3 text-[15px] text-apple-dark placeholder:text-apple-secondary/50 focus:outline-none focus:border-apple-blue focus:ring-1 focus:ring-apple-blue/30 transition-colors"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="bg-apple-dark text-white font-medium rounded-full px-7 py-3 text-[15px] hover:bg-black transition-colors active:scale-[0.97] cursor-pointer shrink-0"
          >
            Join Early Access
          </button>
        </form>
        <p class="hero-success mt-3 text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium hidden">You're in! We'll be in touch soon.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] text-apple-secondary/60">Free to join. <strong class="text-apple-dark"><span class="signup-counter">0</span> have joined</strong>. We'll notify you when it's ready.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ THE GAP ════════ -->
    <section data-section="problem" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          Health data is everywhere.<br/>Meaning is usually missing.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-[15px] md:text-base text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Heart rate, HRV, sleep, activity, and stress all change together. Most apps show separate charts. HealthPulse
          connects these signals so you can make decisions with context.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">59</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">HealthKit metrics supported in the product model</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">8</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">health categories scored together</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">1</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">daily readiness view to start your day</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ WHAT HEALTHPULSE DOES ════════ -->
    <section data-section="solution" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          What HealthPulse gives you every day.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Built for practical decisions: when to push, when to recover, and what trend needs attention now.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v2.25m6.364.386-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Recovery and readiness</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              A daily score with category context so you can quickly see if your body is ready, strained, or trending down.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:100ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Risk and trend signals</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Detects meaningful shifts across metrics, not just single outliers, and prioritizes what to watch first.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 0 1 0-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178Z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Action you can follow</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Sleep, strain, stress, and behavior guidance tied to your data history so each recommendation has context.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ PRODUCT EXPERIENCE ════════ -->
    <section data-section="signature-engines" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          A focused product flow: Home, Explore, and Journal.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          HealthPulse is built for short daily check-ins and deeper weekly review, without forcing manual tracking all day.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Home: your daily health brief</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Recovery, Vitality Age, Sleep Coach, Strain, Stress, and risk items are prioritized so you know what matters today.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Explore: trends and deeper context</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Review score breakdowns, declining metrics, correlations, and what-if simulation context to understand where change is happening.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Journal + cycle-aware insights</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Log daily behaviors, uncover personal correlations, and for women who opt in, add phase-aware cycle guidance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ SCORE SHOWCASE ════════ -->
    <section data-section="score" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          One daily score with category-level context.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Designed to show readiness at a glance, then let you drill into the specific categories driving your score.
        </p>

        <!-- Score ring -->
        <div class="mt-14 flex justify-center">
          <div class="score-showcase">
            <div class="score-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="relative w-44 h-44 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 md:w-64 md:h-64 mx-auto">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 280 280" class="w-full h-full" aria-hidden="true">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="ring-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0071e3"/>
                    <stop offset="40%" stop-color="#34d399"/>
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#06b6d4"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                  <filter id="ring-glow">
                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6" result="blur"/>
                    <feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge>
                  </filter>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="#e8e8ed" stroke-width="12"/>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="url(#ring-grad)" stroke-width="12"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-dasharray="753.98"
                  stroke-dashoffset="98"
                  filter="url(#ring-glow)"
                  class="origin-center -rotate-90 score-ring-animate"/>
              </svg>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                <span class="score-counter text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-apple-dark" data-target="84">0</span>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-apple-secondary mt-1">out of 100</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Categories -->
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></span> Heart
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:40ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></span> Sleep
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span> Activity
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-orange-500 rounded-full"></span> Body
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full"></span> Respiratory
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-purple-500 rounded-full"></span> Mindfulness
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:240ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-teal-500 rounded-full"></span> Mobility
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:280ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-amber-600 rounded-full"></span> Nutrition
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-xs text-apple-secondary/60">
          Sample visualization. HealthPulse scores are computed from your own baseline data and available metrics.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ CORE CAPABILITIES ════════ -->
    <section data-section="features" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          Actionable health intelligence, not dashboard noise.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          The current product focuses on decisions: recovery, sleep, strain balance, risk signals, behavior correlations,
          and long-term review.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.72 9.72 0 0 1 18 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 0 0 3 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 0 0 9.002-5.998Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Sleep Coach</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Tracks sleep debt, consistency, and recommended hours so nightly recovery choices are clearer.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f97316" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0 1 12 21 8.25 8.25 0 0 1 6.038 7.047 8.287 8.287 0 0 0 9 9.601a8.983 8.983 0 0 1 3.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 0 0 3 2.48Z"/>
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18a3.75 3.75 0 0 0 .495-7.468 5.99 5.99 0 0 0-1.925 3.547 5.975 5.975 0 0 1-2.133-1.001A3.75 3.75 0 0 0 12 18Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Strain and recovery balance</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Shows whether your training load is under, optimal, or overreaching based on your current recovery state.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Health risk signals</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Highlights moderate and high-risk changes, including illness-warning style pattern shifts across metrics.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 14.25v2.25m3-4.5v4.5m3-6.75v6.75m3-9v9M6 20.25h12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 20.25 18V6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 3.75H6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3.75 6v12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 6 20.25Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Trends and correlations</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Surfaces declining metrics, cross-metric relationships, causal patterns, and simulation-informed decision support.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#14b8a6" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Journal-powered insights</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Links behaviors like caffeine, alcohol, stress, or screen time with next-day recovery and performance outcomes.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:180ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-pink-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ec4899" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21s-6.716-4.355-9.071-8.324C1.313 9.935 2.5 6.75 5.625 6.75c2.042 0 3.138 1.14 3.75 2.25.612-1.11 1.708-2.25 3.75-2.25 3.125 0 4.312 3.185 2.696 5.926C18.716 16.645 12 21 12 21Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Cycle tracking support</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Women can opt in during onboarding for phase-aware recovery, training, and sleep guidance.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:90ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-green-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5.25 7.5h13.5M5.25 12h13.5M5.25 16.5h13.5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Live health view</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Streams current vitals and activity while your wearable is active, with freshness and staleness indicators.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:150ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 21 18.75V16.5M16.5 12 12 16.5m0 0L7.5 12m4.5 4.5V3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Monthly and annual reviews</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Review longer-term score trends, wins, and records, then share summaries when needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ INSIGHT EXAMPLES ════════ -->
    <section data-section="insights" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          The kind of insights users actually act on.
        </h2>
